<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African rand firms seven cts to 4.70 against dlr.</title>
<headline>S.African rand firms seven cts to 4.70 against dlr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profit-taking by offshore and local players pushed the rand back below the 4.70 level in late Thursday morning trade -- a seven cent reversal from a record low of 4.7670 bid touched earlier in the day.</p>
</text>
